  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_BoomEconomico
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Boom Econ\xF4mico"
  _titleEn: Economic Boom
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Um ciclo de crescimento traz empregos e arrecada\xE7\xE3o, mas tamb\xE9m
    atrai gente mais r\xE1pido do que a cidade consegue receber."
  _summaryEn: A growth cycle brings jobs and revenue, but also attracts people faster
    than the city can absorb them.
  _realWorld: "Maca\xE9, no norte fluminense, cresceu muito com o petr\xF3leo da
    Bacia de Campos e virou conhecida como capital nacional do petr\xF3leo, com a
    press\xE3o sobre moradia e servi\xE7os que veio junto."
  _realWorldEn: "Maca\xE9, in Rio de Janeiro state, grew rapidly with oil from the
    Campos Basin and became known as Brazil's oil capital, with the pressure on housing
    and services that came with it."
  _tradeOffs: "Depender de um s\xF3 setor deixa a cidade exposta quando o ciclo acaba;
    guardar parte da receita ajuda na queda."
  _tradeOffsEn: Depending on a single sector leaves the city exposed when the cycle
    ends; saving part of the revenue helps in the downturn.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Maca\xE9 (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maca%C3%A9
